        <li><strong>Images:</strong> descriptive filenames, alt text, compressed, WebP format, lazy loading</li>
        <li><strong>Internal Linking:</strong> important pages well-linked, descriptive anchor text, no broken links, no orphan pages</li>
        <li><strong>Keyword Targeting:</strong> clear primary keyword per page, no cannibalization, logical topical clusters</li>
      </ul>

